  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Martha Little Fuentes</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4037 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-anne-briggs tag-brian-powers tag-cape-cod-art-center tag-doris-mee tag-larry-folding tag-martha-little-fuentes\" id=\"post-4037\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"All new england 2018 exhibit flyer.\" src=\"/media/archive/90629c140aa39b3390f0386483f0b1bbf3caa77e12db9541b5b9aa4095ea6b4d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The All New England Opens at the Cape Cod Art Center</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T16:18:08-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 4:18 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Cape Cod Art Center, Barnstable Mass announced acceptance of artists in their Annual Juried Show, “The All New England” Guild members whose work will be exhibited: Anne Briggs, Larry <a href=\"/news/the-all-new-england-opens-at-the-cape-cod-art-center/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3752 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-toast-of-harwich tag-wequassett\" id=\"post-3752\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"838\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a group of people dancing.\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">17th Annual Toast of Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and <a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-artweek tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-kathleen-magnusson tag-larry-folding tag-lydia-bell tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yvette-stenzel\" id=\"post-3684\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman painting with watercolors at a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/00421df83ff95b315a4308f2588b50a921d82bd450400bc624f11b2de9128f5b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-03T01:06:43-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 3, 2018, 1:06 am\">April 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>April Meetings: Executive Board Meeting:  Monday, April 9, 2018, 9:30a.m. at Harwich Chamber of Commerce Board Room, 1 Schoolhouse Road, Harwich Port Gallery Meeting:  Saturday, April 21, 2018, 12:30 p.m <a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3546 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-martha-little-fuentes\" id=\"post-3546\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-martha-little-fuentes/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Ernesto by Martha Little Fuentes\" src=\"/media/archive/f0a817b62eec4c3f1fce896411813cb9315959eb5996f6836243835ab853de0b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-martha-little-fuentes/\" rel=\"bookmark\">February Guest Artist, Martha Little Fuentes</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-02-05T13:29:57-05:00\" title=\"Monday, February 5, 2018, 1:29 pm\">February 5, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists Meeting on February 17, 2018 at 2:00p.m. at the Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich, will feature guest artist and Guild member, Martha Little <a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-martha-little-fuentes/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3217 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-news tag-erica-dale-strzepek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3217\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/july-29-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"©Martha Little Fuentes, The Practice Session. Oil on canvas, 11 x 14 inches\" src=\"/media/archive/b4f76120471fe083396bc4fe7d32e1e41ac97f0440642b31dfe98ff8e4b09b78.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/july-29-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">July 29 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-20T15:55:35-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, July 20, 2017, 3:55 pm\">July 20, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet The Artists, Martha Little Fuentes and Erica Dale Strzepek, Saturday, July 29 from 2 – 4 pm at The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists Little Fuentes <a href=\"/news/july-29-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
